WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.316
Dad.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:40.790
It's nice fighting in secret
like this, isn't it?

00:00:42.083 --> 00:00:44.335
It is quite befitting for you.

00:00:44.961 --> 00:00:46.046
However…

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.341
That's right.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:54.220
I remembered something
that's not in the scenario.

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:02.979
A hero must appeal to
the public with their actions.

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.650
Otherwise, they lose
their reason for being.

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.653
Don't you agree?

00:01:11.362 --> 00:01:12.655
What are you talking about?

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.411
What is that?

00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:22.123
Stop!

